Governing Body. Sh. V.P. Gupta was appointed by the \ncompetent authority as Registrar in 2002 and he has been functioning s ince then as \nRegistrar, AIIMS. His continuance in the post of Registrar was also considered by the \nGoverning Body in its meeting held in \n\nStatements by [30 AUG, 2007] Minister   295 \nJanuary, 2007 and again in May, 2007 and the Governing Body decided that he should continue \nto function as Registrar. The degrees forwarded by the institute were, however, signed by \none Dr. Sandeep Aggarwal who is not Registrar, AIIMS appointed by the Governing Body. \nI have returned the degrees to the Director, AIIMS for rectifying the mistake at the earliest so \nthat the degrees to the students who require such degree urgently can be issued \nimmediately. \nYou will appreciate, Sir, any degree signed by an unauthorized person will render the \ndegree illegal and invalid, it is unfortunate that the resident doctors resorted to strike without \nappreciating my concern for their future. I have instructed the Director, AIIMS to take necessary \nsteps to ensure the strike is called off and the patient care services in the Institute are \nrestored immediately. \nMy utmost sympathy is with the students who are waiting for award of degrees for more \nthan two years which is primarily due to delay in holding convocation. I have asked the \nDirector, AIIMS to convene the convocation within a period of one month so that pending \ndegrees could be awarded to the students without any further delay. \n \nश्री एस.एस. अहलुवा�लया (झारखंड) : यह क्या मतलब ह�?...(व्यवधान)... \nTHE MINISTER OF OVERSEAS INDIAN AFFAIRS (SHRI VYALAR RAVI): This is an \nimportant statement. Why can't you allow? This is not fair. ...(Interruptions)... \n \nश्री उपसभाप�त : प्ल�ज़ बै�ठए । आप बै�ठए ।...(व्यवधान)... म� �रक्वेस्ट कर रहा हूं । \n...(व्यवधान)... म� बोल रहा हूं, म� �रक्वेस्ट कर रहा हूं, आप बै�ठए।...(व्यवधान)... \nAhluwaliaji, you see the records, ho w many times, in this House, the 